# Excalidraw Desktop workspace (packages/desktop)
# `build` and `dist` are already ignored by the patterns above; the desktop workspace
# needs `build/` tracked (it holds the committed icon assets, D-31) and `dist/`
# ignored (esbuild output). `release/` and `webapp-staging/` are packaging output.
!packages/desktop/build/
!packages/desktop/build/**
packages/desktop/release/
packages/desktop/webapp-staging/
